{"hw":"ἀπορραίνω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀπορραίνω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀπορραίνω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">spirt out, shed about,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τοῦ θοροῦ, τῶν ᾠῶν</span> (partit. gen.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.93</span> </span>: c. acc., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">567a31</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Dsc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eup.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.235</span> </span>, al. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">sprinkle, douche,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Epict.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ench.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4</span> </span>:—esp. in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">sprinkle</b> by way of lustration, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.121</span> </span>,al. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be dissolved,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Olymp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">in Mete.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">228.6</span> </span> (dub.).</div></div>"}